# Reading: holders never overlap. With a 1s hold, a late contender reclaims the
# lock ~47s after the first holder exited (a legitimate dead-pid reclaim), because
# spawning 40 Git Bash processes takes ~30s here. With the holder alive for the
# whole contention window (15s hold) there is exactly one winner.
